    // single host FIFO adds dependencies that do not exist in the guest: one
    // slow ACB dispatch can delay a graphics clear until the CPU has reused
    // that heap. Keep FIFO order within each logical guest queue and schedule
    // ready queues round-robin. Explicit WAIT_REG_MEM packets preserve guest
    // synchronization, while conservative resource producer/consumer edges below
    // prevent host reordering of shared images/depth/global buffers across queues.
